  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<!--Do not edit this div tag.  It must surround the interaction block-->
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="2735c058-1719-40b5-84c1-479d866f5979"><problem><para>
      <para>For questions 1 – 3, find the GCF of each set of expressions.</para>
      <para>\(12m^2n^3, 30m^5n^3\)</para>
      </para><para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(6m^3n^3\)</para><para>\(3m^2n^3\)</para><para>\(2m^5n^3\)</para><para>\(6m^2n^3\)</para></problem><solution><para>\(6m^2n^3\)</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is \(6m^2n^3\).
      </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
